<title>FRANCE: Pernod Ricard H1 profit rises.</title>
<headline>Pernod Ricard H1 profit rises.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-09-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to end June, 1996.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of French francs unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net attributable			     504  vs	     490</p>
<p>    Total net					512  vs	     497</p>
<p>    Pre-tax, pre-exceptional		   697  vs	     686</p>
<p>    Exceptional gains			     15  vs		13</p>
<p>    Operating					771  vs	     790</p>
<p>    Net financial costs			   74  vs	     104</p>
<p>    Turnover				     7,995  vs	   7,663</p>
<p>    Cash flow				    4,339  vs	   4,209</p>
<p>NOTE - Pernod Ricard gave the results in a statement. It said that on a like for like basis, turnover rose five percent.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
</text>
